WEBVTT

00:02.567 --> 00:04.833
Online, in the room, or both at once.

00:05.600 --> 00:10.967
In a meeting room, one microphone is enough. Echo cancellation keeps the room clean.

00:11.733 --> 00:15.300
Liam Turner: I will complete the bottom inspection before the blasting starts.

00:15.633 --> 00:19.833
Speaker labels tell the voices apart, and learn the people you meet often.

00:20.600 --> 00:25.233
For a hybrid meeting, the room and the online call go into the same transcript.
